{"s":96,"v":[{"t":"Recite in the name of your Lord who created","w":[["ٱقْرَأْ","Read","iq'ra",""],["بِٱسْمِ","in (the) name","bi-is'mi","",[["بِ",10],["ٱسْمِ",312]]],["رَبِّكَ","(of) your Lord","rabbika","",[["رَبِّ",24],["كَ",18]]],["ٱلَّذِى","the One Who","alladhī",""],["خَلَقَ","created ","khalaqa",""]]},{"t":"Created man from a clinging substance.","w":[["خَلَقَ","He created","khalaqa",""],["ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","man","l-insāna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["إِنسَـٰنَ",181]]],["مِنْ","from","min",""],["عَلَقٍ","a clinging substance","ʿalaqin",""]]},{"t":"Recite, and your Lord is the most Generous -","w":[["ٱقْرَأْ","Read","iq'ra",""],["وَرَبُّكَ","and your Lord","warabbuka","",[["وَ",1],["رَبُّ",24],["كَ",18]]],["ٱلْأَكْرَمُ","(is) the Most Generous","l-akramu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَكْرَمُ",2147]]]]},{"t":"Who taught by the pen","w":[["ٱلَّذِى","The One Who","alladhī",""],["عَلَّمَ","taught","ʿallama",""],["بِٱلْقَلَمِ","by the pen","bil-qalami","",[["بِ",10],["ٱلْ",2],["قَلَمِ",1600]]]]},{"t":"Taught man that which he knew not.","w":[["عَلَّمَ","Taught","ʿallama",""],["ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","man","l-insāna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["إِنسَـٰنَ",181]]],["مَا","what","mā",""],["لَمْ","not","lam",""],["يَعْلَمْ","he knew","yaʿlam",""]]},{"t":"No! [But] indeed, man transgresses","w":[["كَلَّآ","Nay","kallā",""],["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ","man","l-insāna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["إِنسَـٰنَ",181]]],["لَيَطْغَىٰٓ","surely transgresses","layaṭghā","",[["لَ",23],["يَطْغَىٰٓ",731]]]]},{"t":"Because he sees himself self-sufficient.","w":[["أَن","That","an",""],["رَّءَاهُ","he sees himself","raāhu","",[["رَّءَا",60],["هُ",5]]],["ٱسْتَغْنَىٰٓ","self-sufficient","is'taghnā",""]]},{"t":"Indeed, to your Lord is the return.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["إِلَىٰ","to","ilā",""],["رَبِّكَ","your Lord","rabbika","",[["رَبِّ",24],["كَ",18]]],["ٱلرُّجْعَىٰٓ","(is) the return","l-ruj'ʿā","",[["ٱل",2],["رُّجْعَىٰٓ",3557]]]]},{"t":"Have you seen the one who forbids","w":[["أَرَءَيْتَ","Have you seen","ara-ayta",